# --- Optional: enable inline Google Street View previews ---------------
#
# Without this key, the building panel preview falls back to a Wikimedia
# Commons photo (where available) and an OpenStreetMap map tile (always),
# both of which are key-free and outdoor-safe but cannot show a real
# panorama.
#
# When this key is set, VIBLOC uses Google's official Maps Embed API
# (Street View mode) to render the actual Street View panorama inside the
# building panel. Before embedding, we resolve the BEST outdoor pano via
# the Street View Static metadata API (`source=outdoor` flag, expanding
# 30/60/100 m radius), so the embed never lands on a user-uploaded indoor
# Photo Sphere — even for buildings right on top of a Tokyo / Seoul
# subway concourse. The Overpass-based subway-entrance sanitizer in
# `lib/subwayAvoid.ts` runs first to push the query coordinate away from
# any nearby station mouth.
#
# Both endpoints we use are FREE on Google Maps Platform:
#   - `embed/v1/streetview`     - free, unlimited
#   - `streetview/metadata`     - free, $0/1000 calls
# So enabling this costs nothing as long as you don't also use other
# Maps Platform APIs with the same key.
#
# How to get the key:
#   1. https://console.cloud.google.com/
#   2. Create a new project (or pick an existing one)
#   3. Enable: "Maps Embed API" + "Street View Static API"
#   4. APIs & Services → Credentials → Create API key
#   5. Restrict it to HTTP referrers and limit to Embed + Street View
#      Static APIs only
#   6. Paste below and rename this file to `.env.local`
#
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_EMBED_KEY=
